traffic that Loki must negotiate

00:34:21.602 --> 00:34:22.889
as we enter the subway station.

00:34:23.748 --> 00:34:26.918
Watch how he stops at the top
of the stairs and waits for me

00:34:26.918 --> 00:34:28.437
to give the command to proceed.

00:34:29.285 --> 00:34:32.180
Just like down curbs, that's
super important for our safety.

00:34:36.549 --> 00:34:36.579
Yeah, right here.

00:34:36.579 --> 00:34:36.599
Right right.

00:34:40.324 --> 00:34:42.168
[Unintelligible]

00:34:46.578 --> 00:34:48.266
Right, and then there's
some stairs on the right

00:34:49.054 --> 00:34:49.359
Sherose Badruddin: Yeah.

00:34:49.414 --> 00:34:49.746
Yeah.

00:34:51.840 --> 00:34:52.123
Yeah.

00:34:52.176 --> 00:34:52.426
Ed Summers: Okay.

00:34:52.491 --> 00:34:53.053
Stairs down?

00:34:53.245 --> 00:34:55.192
Down the stairs, yeah.

00:34:55.192 --> 00:34:55.203
Forward.

00:34:55.203 --> 00:34:55.223
Steady boy.

00:35:12.895 --> 00:35:17.140
Well, thank you so much for hosting me
here at WordPress Accessibility Day.

00:35:17.165 --> 00:35:22.179
It's really been a, a true pleasure
to share this exciting renaissance of

00:35:22.180 --> 00:35:23.586
achievement for people with disabilities.

00:35:23.587 --> 00:35:28.448
I think it's just getting started, and
I'm just so, so incredibly thankful to

00:35:28.448 --> 00:35:33.749
be a part of it and to helply… and,
and to frankly, hopefully move it along

00:35:33.749 --> 00:35:37.587
a little bit and, and empower people
with disabilities to build technology

00:35:37.636 --> 00:35:39.273
and use technology more effectively.

00:35:39.881 --> 00:35:45.597
I am-- my handle on most of
the socials is edsummersnc.

00:35:45.707 --> 00:35:49.645
E-D-S-U-M-M-E-R-S-N-C.

00:35:50.237 --> 00:35:54.352
And particularly my best place to
